Study source for the chat reader (nothing copied)
--------------------------------------------------
reader/adapters/*.json (selector packs) were written after READING the chat-page code of
Social Stream Ninja, https://github.com/steveseguin/social_stream (author: Steve Seguin and
contributors), to learn which elements of each platform's chat page carry the author, text, emotes and
badges. Only facts about the platforms' pages (class names, data attributes, element structure) were
used; no code, no expressions and no text were copied, and reader/lib/inject.js is original.
