Chat voices (data/voice/node_modules, data/voices)
--------------------------------------------------
sherpa-onnx-node 1.13.8 and sherpa-onnx-win-x64 1.13.8 (k2-fsa, https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx)
  Licence: Apache-2.0. From the npm registry, pinned by integrity (scripts/package.ps1). The native
  package contains sherpa-onnx-c-api.dll, sherpa-onnx-cxx-api.dll and ONNX Runtime (onnxruntime.dll,
  onnxruntime_providers_shared.dll; Microsoft, MIT licence), and espeak-ng phoneme data ships inside
  each voice pack (espeak-ng, GPL-3.0-or-later; the plugin is GPL-2.0-or-later and the helper is a
  separate program that loads it).
Voice packs (data/voices/<pack>): unchanged archives from the k2-fsa tts-models release
  (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/tts-models), each pinned by SHA-256
  (voice/pins.json). Kokoro v1.0 (hexgrad, Apache-2.0) and Piper voices (rhasspy / OHF-Voice; each
  voice under the licence named in its MODEL_CARD). A pack ships only if its own model card names a
  licence that allows redistribution and commercial use (scripts/fetch-voices.js); the licence and
  the opening of each model card are listed in docs/voice-licences.md of the release.
